  "goodToKnow": "Die Einwilligung is consent, a key legal term: die Einwilligung des Patienten, die Einwilligungserklärung (consent form). Under the GDPR (in German: DSGVO), Einwilligung is one legal basis for processing personal data, hence the cookie banners. Germany also protects das Recht am eigenen Bild: generally, photos of people can't be published without their Einwilligung. The verb is einwilligen in. Plural: die Einwilligungen."
